s_e9efdd91561c5258cd9974c82d71813ce37d0ec4e90f31cd6ae7cac7818844ab_promise_0: "Unverified intent: Adapt a local file URI to its current UTF-8 saved text for DocumentSources. Missing files and unsupported URI schemes return absence. Other filesystem errors surface. Do not scan folders, acquire packages, cache business state or replace open editor text." {shape: page}
